# Build context of Dockerfile.prebuilt only (`docker build … services/panel-api`):
# the prebuilt jar and the two scripts, nothing else (no src/, no classes).
# services/panel-api/Dockerfile builds from the repo root and uses the root
# .dockerignore instead; this file does not apply to it.
*
!docker/launch.sh
!docker/healthcheck.sh
!target/panel-api-*.jar
